l_skills_linkedin_funnel_context_raw_sources_2026_09_22_sarene_master_reference_sereen_master_reference_keynote_workshop_combo_offering", "label": "Keynote + Workshop combo offering ($10,000)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "External-Skills/linkedin-funnel/context/raw/sources/2026-09-22-sarene-master-reference/Sereen_Master_Reference.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "external_skills_linkedin_funnel_context_raw_sources_2026_09_22_sarene_master_reference_sereen_master_reference_positioning_statement", "label": "Positioning Statement", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "External-Skills/linkedin-funnel/context/raw/sources/2026-09-22-sarene-master-reference/Sereen_Master_Reference.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Values aren't just a moral stance, they're a business advantage; B Corp certification proves values were tested and verified rather than merely claimed, differentiating her from theorists in leadership/values speaking."}, {"id": "external_skills_linkedin_funnel_context_raw_sources_2026_09_22_sarene_master_reference_sereen_master_reference_brand_story", "label": "Brand Story (Catalyst/Core Truth/Proof narrative)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "External-Skills/linkedin-funnel/context/raw/sources/2026-09-22-sarene-master-reference/Sereen_Master_Reference.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Business-challenge framing, not biography: the real test of a company's values is where they show up operationally, not what's claimed; B Corp certification is offered as the outside-audited proof of that test applied to her own company first."}, {"id": "external_skills_linkedin_funnel_context_raw_sources_2026_09_22_sarene_master_reference_sereen_master_reference_topic_selection_lane", "label": "Topic Selection: the values-gap lane", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "External-Skills/linkedin-funnel/context/raw/sources/2026-09-22-sarene-master-reference/Sereen_Master_Reference.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Opening narrowly on whether stated values show up in practice (framed financially via turnover/trust/differentiation, not purely ethically) was chosen because opening broad would dilute the whole positioning; checked against passion, timeliness (ESG/greenwashing skepticism) and behavior-change filters."}, {"id": "external_skills_linkedin_funnel_context_raw_sources_2026_09_22_sarene_master_reference_sereen_master_reference_content_plan_80_20", "label": "80/20 Content Plan (9 content types, 4 personal categories)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "External-Skills/linkedin-funnel/context/raw/sources/2026-09-22-sarene-master-reference/Sereen_Master_Reference.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "external_skills_linkedin_funnel_context_raw_sources_2026_09_22_sarene_master_reference_sereen_master_reference_content_formats", "label": "Content Formats (Talking-Head, Story-Time, Risky Text, Rating, Ask Sereen, Voiceover)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "External-Skills/linkedin-funnel/context/raw/sources/2026-09-22-sarene-master-reference/Sereen_Master_Reference.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "external_skills_linkedin_funnel_context_raw_sources_2026_09_22_sarene_master_reference_sereen_master_reference_voice_reference", "label": "Voice Reference (delivery traits from two real talks)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "External-Skills/linkedin-funnel/context/raw/sources/2026-09-22-sarene-master-reference/Sereen_Master_Reference.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_a